st_adb|ADB recovery if MG4Dash no longer starts: adb shell cmd package compile -m speed -f app.mg4dash|Secours ADB si MG4Dash ne démarre plus : adb shell cmd package compile -m speed -f app.mg4dash|ADB-Notfall, falls MG4Dash nicht mehr startet: adb shell cmd package compile -m speed -f app.mg4dash|Recuperación ADB si MG4Dash ya no arranca: adb shell cmd package compile -m speed -f app.mg4dash|Ripristino ADB se MG4Dash non si avvia più: adb shell cmd package compile -m speed -f app.mg4dash|ADB-herstel als MG4Dash niet meer start: adb shell cmd package compile -m speed -f app.mg4dash|MG4Dash artık açılmıyorsa ADB ile kurtarma: adb shell cmd package compile -m speed -f app.mg4dash
